        {
            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41483",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clients/openWindow\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clients/openWindow</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Examples</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This example as it stands does not work as one would expect. There is a check being made to see if <code class=\"notranslate\">client.url</code> matches the notification URL. But the <code class=\"notranslate\">client.url</code> will not change after subsequent navigation, thus even if the notification URL matches the actual \"current URL\", this check will not pass - and hence the current window will not be focused - thus defeating the purpose of this example.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Dunno. Since this piece of code does not work as expected, and in fact is downright misleading, it should be removed.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"626821473\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515/hovercard?comment_id=3389562474&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515#issuecomment-3389562474\">w3c/ServiceWorker#1515 (comment)</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN metadata</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Page report details</summary>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Folder: <code class=\"notranslate\">en-us/web/api/clients/openwindow</code></li>\n<li>MDN URL: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clients/openWindow\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clients/openWindow</a></li>\n<li>GitHub URL: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/clients/openwindow/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/clients/openwindow/index.md</a></li>\n<li>Last commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/364a4d02b10854ab7cef4ff4b0ec3616d4e1c8ab/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/364a4d02b10854ab7cef4ff4b0ec3616d4e1c8ab\"><tt>364a4d0</tt></a></li>\n<li>Document last modified: 2025-05-23T04:35:27.000Z</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41483",
            "title": "[service-workers-1] Very misleading example for window focus from notification / service worker",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-12T20:28:49.000Z",
