        {
            "id": "https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41482",
            "content_html": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN URL</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Client\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Client</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Instance properties</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Client:URL: The URL of the client as a string.</code></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">What did you expect to see?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Client:URL: The URL of the client as a string. This is the creation URL and will not change upon subsequent navigation. </code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or something to this effect.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"626821473\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515/hovercard?comment_id=3389562474&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1515#issuecomment-3389562474\">w3c/ServiceWorker#1515 (comment)</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>No response</em></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">MDN metadata</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Page report details</summary>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Folder: <code class=\"notranslate\">en-us/web/api/client</code></li>\n<li>MDN URL: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Client\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Client</a></li>\n<li>GitHub URL: <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/client/index.md\">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/client/index.md</a></li>\n<li>Last commit: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/2ef36a6d6f380e79c88bc3a80033e1d3c4629994/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/2ef36a6d6f380e79c88bc3a80033e1d3c4629994\"><tt>2ef36a6</tt></a></li>\n<li>Document last modified: 2024-05-13T06:21:16.000Z</li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
