            "content_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance criteria</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> The listed features are documented sufficiently on MDN</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD is updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Interactive example and data repos are updated if appropriate</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> The content has been reviewed as needed</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">For folks helping with Firefox related documentation</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Set bugs to <code class=\"notranslate\">dev-doc-complete</code></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add entry to Firefox release notes for enabled/preview features</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Add/remove entry to Firefox experimental features page for preference/released features</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related Gecko bugs</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1906301\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1906301</a> - Implement Trusted Types support for <code class=\"notranslate\">document.write()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">document.writeln()</code> - 135\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1905706\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1905706</a> - <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLScriptElement</code> attr src/innerText/textContent/text  - 135\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3416594111\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41128\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41128/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41128\">#41128</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> src/innerText/textContent</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931290\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931290</a> - <code class=\"notranslate\">Window.setInterval()</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">setTimeout()</code>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD updated</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These ones for 136</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940049\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940049</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SVGAnimatedString/baseVal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">SVGAnimatedString.baseVal</code></a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931293\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931293</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WorkerGlobalScope/importScripts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">WorkerGlobalScope.importScripts()</code></a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940044\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940044</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorkerContainer/register\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ServiceWorkerContainer.register()</code></a> - TrustedScriptURL\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3721851420\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42362\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42362/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42362\">#42362</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note these ones for 137</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504</a> onmessage and onreadystatechange attributes - not sure what this means. Asking in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504#c8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504#c8</a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> BCD</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These for 138</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1942306\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1942306</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Content-Security-Policy/trusted-types\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Content-Security-Policy: trusted-types</code></a> - support for setting the allowed trusted type policy names\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs - Already OK</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These for 144</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932</a> see <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932#c21\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932#c21</a>. If CSP enabled, this\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> enforces TT for assignment of script to text -\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"let script = document.createElement(&quot;script&quot;);\nscript.text = &quot;/* arbitrary JS code */&quot;; \"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">let</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">script</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">createElement</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"script\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">text</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">\"/* arbitrary JS code */\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span> </pre></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Check at the script execution part for cases where script is about to be executed because there are cases other than direct assignment of text, where the API does not lend itself to TT (read above link). I think action here is to update TT docs to make it clear these kinds of check exist.\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-js notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"let script = document.createElement(&quot;script&quot;);\nscript.appendChild(document.createTextNode(&quot;/* arbitrary JS code */&quot;));\ndocument.body.appendChild(script);\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">let</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">script</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">createElement</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"script\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s1\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">appendChild</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">createTextNode</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"/* arbitrary JS code */\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">document</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-c1\">body</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-en\">appendChild</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">script</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Other</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Check content open issues to see if any pertain to the subject matter. If there are any that can be closed because of the work, do so. If there are any that can be fixed relatively quickly because of the knowledge from completing this issue and you have time, feel free to go ahead and fix them.</li>\n</ul>",
